INSERT INTO `services` VALUES (1,2,'fab fa-laravel','Web Application',1,'<p>I offer professional web application development services using the Laravel PHP framework, designed to deliver secure, scalable, and high-performance solutions tailored to your business needs. Whether you need a custom business management system, SaaS platform, e-commerce store, or API backend, I provide end-to-end Laravel development to bring your vision to life. My expertise includes building enterprise-grade applications like CRM, ERP, and project management tools, as well as real-time applications with live updates and notifications. I also specialize in RESTful and GraphQL API development, seamless third-party integrations (payment gateways, SMS, social logins), and database optimization for MySQL.<br><br>Additionally, I offer maintenance and optimization services, including performance tuning, security hardening, bug fixes, and server deployment. My full-stack approach ensures smooth frontend integration with Vue.js, React, or Blade templating, and I can also set up mobile app backends for Flutter or React Native applications.</p>',1,'2025-03-28 09:36:16','2025-03-28 09:36:16'),(2,2,'fab fa-android','Android Application',2,'<p>I also specialize in cross-platform mobile app development using Flutter, enabling businesses to launch high-performance Android applications with a single codebase. Flutter’s powerful framework allows me to build sleek, natively compiled apps with smooth animations and responsive UIs that work seamlessly across devices. My Flutter development services cover custom mobile apps for startups and enterprises on-demand service apps, and business productivity tools.&nbsp;<br><br>I integrate Firebase for backend services (authentication, real-time databases, cloud storage) and connect apps to RESTful APIs built with Laravel or Node.js for robust functionality. Whether you need state management with Provider or Bloc, offline data sync, or push notifications, I implement best practices for scalability and maintainability. Additionally, I optimize app performance, reduce load times, and ensure secure data handling for sensitive user information. From prototyping to publishing on the Google Play Store, I provide end-to-end Flutter development, along with post-launch support and updates.</p>',1,'2025-03-28 09:41:57','2025-03-28 09:41:57');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `services` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

